<title>UK: S&amp;P withdraws Bally Entertainment ratings.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P withdraws Bally Entertainment ratings.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's said on Monday it had removed its ratings of Bally Entertainment and subsidiaries from CreditWatch and withdrawn the ratings after the Bally's acquisition by Hilton Hotels.  </p>
<p>S&amp;P said the following ratings were withdrawn and removed from creditwatch:</p>
<p>Bally Entertainment Corp.</p>
<p>  Corp credit rtg			     BB</p>
<p>  Sub debt					B plus</p>
<p>  Pfd stk					 BB minus</p>
<p>GNF Corp.</p>
<p>  Corp credit rtg			     BB</p>
<p>  Sr secd debt				  BB</p>
<p>Bally's Park Place Funding Inc.</p>
<p>  Corp credit rtg			     BB</p>
<p>  Sr secd debt				  BB</p>
<p>Bally's Casino Holdings Inc.</p>
<p>  Corp credit rtg			     BB</p>
<p>  Sr unsecd debt				B plus</p>
<p>Bally's Grand Inc.</p>
<p>  Corp credit rtg			     BB</p>
<p>  Sr secd debt				  BB</p>
<p>-- Kate Kelland, International Bonds Unit +44 171 542 8682</p>
</text>
